# Volta per-project workspace
# Generated automatically on first run — safe to edit by hand.

# Raw chat transcripts and session state can contain pasted secrets,
# customer data, or simply churn too much to be worth diffing in git.
/history/

# Regenerable semantic-search cache: large, machine-specific, and rebuilt
# automatically — not worth versioning.
/memory/embedder_index/

# Repeated-failure tracking is session-local debugging state, not knowledge
# worth sharing with the team.
/memory/bootloop_state.json

# Everything else — board_profile.json, notes.md, skills/, plans/ — is
# intentionally tracked: it's project knowledge meant to travel with the
# repo and be shared across the team.
